Package: jetson-imx708-dual-dkms
Architecture: arm64
Depends: dkms, build-essential, device-tree-compiler, v4l-utils, i2c-tools, python3, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: nvidia-l4t-kernel-headers, nvidia-l4t-kernel-oot-headers
Description: Dual-CSI Sony IMX708 (Pi Camera Module 3 Wide) DKMS driver for Jetson Orin Nano
 Out-of-tree Linux kernel V4L2/Tegracam driver (nv_imx708) and dual-CSI Device
 Tree overlays for running two Raspberry Pi Camera Module 3 Wide (Sony IMX708)
 sensors on the NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano Developer Kit (p3768-0000).
 .
 Supports 4608x2592@14fps, 2304x1296@56fps (2x2 binned full wide FOV), and
 1536x864@120fps across JetPack 6.x (L4T R36.x), JetPack 7.x (L4T R38.x), and
 JetPack 5.1.x (L4T R35.x). Rebuilds automatically via DKMS on kernel upgrades.
